                                "sense_id": "dd02ceec-2362-3fec-880d-bb0633f1f2b9",
                                "text": "Deviated septum, a shift from the midline that commonly occurs in normal growth, is present in most adults."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "78282483-8dbe-49d3-bfc2-be9236960e13",
                                "sense_id": "dd02ceec-2362-3fec-880d-bb0633f1f2b9",
                                "text": "Sally got a dagger hung from her septum\nO'Malley cut his ears off, but wishes that he kept 'em"
